Show remaining credit and the last day's spend

Usage: wally account usage [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --json                  Print as JSON
      --requests              List settled requests instead of the summary (one
                              page; --follow reads them all)
      --days INT              Window length in days (1-31)
      --since TEXT            Window start, with a timezone (e.g.
                              2026-09-25T00:00:00Z)
      --until TEXT            Window end, with a timezone (default: now; needs
                              --since)
      --model TEXT            Only this model id
      --status INT            Only this HTTP status (100-599)
      --response-request-id TEXT
                              Only the rows for this x-request-id (what a
                              response logged)
      --cursor TEXT           Continue from a previous page's next_cursor (needs
                              --since and --until)
      --limit INT             Rows per page (1-200)
      --follow                Read every page until the window is done

Examples:
  wally account usage

  wally --json account usage

  # every settled request of the last day, first page
  wally account usage --requests

  # a full week, every page
  wally account usage --requests --days 7 --follow

  # the requests our side failed
  wally account usage --requests --status 500

  # the rows behind one x-request-id
  wally account usage --requests --response-request-id <id>

  # one page as JSON, over a pinned window
  wally --json account usage --requests --since 2026-09-24T00:00:00Z --until 2026-09-25T00:00:00Z
